{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Search for object, take and process it, deliver it or approach it, while monitoring environment. list of available nodes: <Action ID = SearchForObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = DeliverObject    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = ExploreEnvironment    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectInReach    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    />",
